    {
      "Action": "EditData",
      "Target": "Data/mail",
      "Entries": {
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Welcome": "@,^Welcome to the workshop. The Curator will show you the bundle board in the Entrance Hall.^Decompose things in the Athanor, combine Primes at the Table, and write down everything.^   -Oriel[#]Welcome",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Tobin": "Heard you got the old furnace lit.^I'll be in the workshop from today. I've brought plans for a coal-fired Calcinator. Faster than that old Athanor, if less pretty.^   -Tobin[#]Tobin",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Finch": "Greetings, alchemist!^My wagon rolls into the workshop's hall each week. Rare reagents, fair prices, and a curiosity or two.^   -Finch[#]Finch",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Ivo": "Farmer.^I'm at the Guild. I trade for monster parts. Come and see.^   -Ivo[#]Ivo",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Delta": "Hello!^I'm doing research at the tide pools. If you've caught anything unusual, I'd love to see it.^   -Delta[#]Delta",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Bennet": "Hi! Aunt Sandy says you're the alchemist everyone's talking about.^I've got a kiln out in the desert, and plans for a Pelican: glass that makes substances finer. Come by!^   -Bennet[#]Bennet",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Chaining": "Right. Lesson one.^Put a machine east of another and the first one passes its output along. West in, east out. A chest south of a machine feeds it.^Power goes north. Do that and your line runs itself.^   -Tobin[#]Chaining",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Sorenson": "To the farmer at the old works,^I am Dr. Sorenson, lately of Joja Research. I offer bulk contracts at above-shipping prices.^Find me in the Cistern.^   -Dr. Sorenson[#]Sorenson",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Coil": "That storm last night! Got me thinking.^Here's how to build a Lightning Coil. It stores Fulgur as charges, and storms top it up for free.^   -Tobin[#]Coil",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Library": "@,^The Library is open again. The Experiment Table now holds three things at once.^Bring Caput Mortuum to the bundle board if you want me to read it for you.^   -the Curator[#]Library",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Hesper": "Dear @,^I'll be visiting the workshop's Observatory a few days each week. I chart the valley's currents. They run under your feet.^   -Hesper[#]Hesper",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_LeyTap": "@,^You've been kind to me, so here is my oldest secret: the Ley Tap. Place it on a ley node and it draws that node's Primes each morning.^The nodes I've charted are in your codex.^   -Hesper[#]LeyTap",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Agnes": "Farmer,^Agnes, Ministry of Mining. I'm stationed at Clint's. I buy and certify metals.^   -Agnes[#]Agnes",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Crucible": "Farmer,^The Quarry is reachable again. The Ministry's old crucible is yours to use: plans enclosed.^I remain unconvinced about the planetary days.^   -Agnes[#]Crucible",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Sanctum": "@,^The Sanctum is restored. The Ritual Altar is yours to build. And the Wizard showed me something: a node under the forest that breathes Aether.^   -Oriel[#]Sanctum",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Undercroft": "Child,^You opened the dark room under the hall. Good. Here is how to make a lantern that holds Shades. Sleep with it, and it fills.^   -the Witch[#]Undercroft",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Observatory": "Dear @,^With the Observatory open I've charted the rest of the valley's nodes. They're in your codex now.^   -Hesper[#]Observatory",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Vault": "@,^The Crystal Vault is restored. Lay a Circle Sigil under an altar and you have a Ritual Circle: one great rite at a time.^   -the Curator[#]Vault",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_GreatWork": "@,^You have restored every room. I remember now. My name was Cyprian, and this was my workshop.^The Great Work is yours to finish.^   -Cyprian[#]GreatWork",
        "CharlesDR.ValleyOpus_Mail_Lark": "Hi!!^I'm Lark, I'm visiting my aunt, and I heard you do ALCHEMY. Can I come and watch? I'll be in the workshop.^   -Lark[#]Lark"
      }
    },
